WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.964
Hi, I'm Sara from A9 Voice.

2
00:00:03.004 --> 00:00:06.041
Names and jargon trip
up any speech engine.

3
00:00:06.081 --> 00:00:08.331
Let's teach A9 Voice your words.

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.666
Open Dictionary and add a word or
name, spelled the way you want it.

5
00:00:13.706 --> 00:00:17.744
It's sent as a hint, so it's more
likely to be heard and spelled right.

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.929
If the same mistake keeps coming back,

7
00:00:20.969 --> 00:00:24.982
add a fix: what it hears on the
left, what you want on the right.

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.806
The same lists work for
dictation and for meeting notes

9
00:00:28.846 --> 00:00:32.461
and summaries are told to spell
your words the way you wrote them.

10
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.048
That's it.

11
00:00:37.088 --> 00:00:38.290
Teach it once.
